# Copy to `.env` for local dev. `.env` is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
# Why this file exists: `.env` was previously tracked in this public repo. The
# one value in it (below) is harmless, but a future Lovable connector sync could
# drop a REAL credential into that same file and publish it. `.env` is now
# untracked and ignored; this template documents what belongs there.

# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID.
# NOT a secret despite the "API_KEY" name Lovable gives it: any `VITE_*` var is
# compiled into the browser bundle, and a GA4 Measurement ID is visible in the
# page source of every site that uses it. It cannot read your analytics data —
# that needs separate OAuth/service-account credentials. Safe to commit.
# Current production value: G-N18CVZ2C3C
VITE_LOVABLE_CONNECTOR_GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_API_KEY="G-N18CVZ2C3C"
